    description: "WHAT. docs/audits/0028 (PR #2329) measured the 28 deleted route rows as 61 forms. Three are detected WRONGLY, not just missed:\n- fastify .route({method, url, handler}): only the path key is read, so the route is recorded as GET / (js_ts _extract_hapi_usage_contexts).\n- Go gorilla HandleFunc(...).Methods(\"GET\"): the chained .Methods is not read; the method is recorded ANY. microservices-demo frontend: 14 routes, 12 with .Methods, all 14 recorded ANY. PathPrefix(p).Subrouter(): the prefix is dropped.\n- Solid <Route path component>: a client-side route, labelled \"HTTP GET\".\n\nASK. Read url as well as path; read the chained .Methods and subrouter prefixes; give a client-side router's routes their own label or kind.\n\nFound during PR #2329 (2026-11-22). Evidence: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/three_pr_plan_11222026/pr2/RESULTS.md and RESIDUALS_TO_FILE.md."  # 078f
